olumn":23,"endLine":159,"line":154},"type":64,"typeText":"∀ {m : Type u_1 → Type u_2} {α β : Type u_1} [inst : Monad.{u_1, u_2} m] [LawfulMonad.{u_1, u_2} m] (f : α → β)\n  (x : m α),\n  Eq.{u_2 + 1} (Functor.map.{u_1, u_2} f x) do\n    let a ← x\n    Pure.pure.{u_1, u_2} (f a)","unsafe":false,"value":133,"source":{"code":"/--\nUse `simp [← bind_pure_comp]` rather than `simp [map_eq_pure_bind]`,\nas `bind_pure_comp` is in the default simp set, so also using `map_eq_pure_bind` would cause a loop.\n-/\ntheorem map_eq_pure_bind [Monad m] [LawfulMonad m] (f : α → β) (x : m α) : f <$> x = x >>= fun a => pure (f a) := by\n  rw [← bind_pure_comp]","start":154,"end":159},"axioms":[]}